#HELPS
1 ABERNANIT SMUGGLER DEN~
Abernanit is a small smuggler den hidden on a peninsula southeast of Gnaar Mok
where trapped doors and hostile beasts guard tunnels filled with stolen goods.
Barrels, crates and locked chests fill stone ledges above pools of murky water
as a kidnapped traveler waits among the armed outlaw gang.~
